or open-source software: no licence to use it is granted.

You may read and study the code, quote excerpts with attribution, and run it
locally for the sole purpose of evaluating it or reporting a problem (see
SECURITY.md).

Without a written agreement with the copyright holder you may not use it, in
whole or in part, in any product or service, free or paid; copy, modify,
distribute or create derivative works from it; or host it or make it available
to others.

The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied, including the warranties of merchantability and fitness for a
particular purpose. In no event shall the copyright holder be liable for any
damages arising from the use of the software.

Mull2Five is unofficial software. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
sponsored by Wizards of the Coast LLC. Magic: The Gathering, card names, and
related marks are property of Wizards of the Coast LLC. This project does not
ship card images.
